    "",
    "As published, all 27 were `low` or `info` — the model rated almost everything",
    "`low` and severity was a ceiling, so evidence could only agree. `matchesRealDefect`",
    "is set from the human-verified truth file, not from the tool.",
    "`requiredMigration` values of \"omit\" — the prompt placeholder echoed back — are recorded as null, which is what the parser now produces."
